  description: Venom Spires trace their origins to biochemical waste processing facilities.
    The spires were designed to neutralize toxic byproducts through controlled corrosion.
    During containment failures, researchers observed their lethal effects on hostile
    organisms. The technology was quickly repurposed, raising lasting questions about
    chemical warfare ethics.
  vnDescription: "Venom Spires c\xF3 ngu\u1ED3n g\u1ED1c t\u1EEB c\xE1c c\u01A1 s\u1EDF
    x\u1EED l\xFD ch\u1EA5t th\u1EA3i sinh h\xF3a. Nh\u1EEFng c\u1ED9t n\xE0y \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    thi\u1EBFt k\u1EBF \u0111\u1EC3 trung h\xF2a c\xE1c s\u1EA3n ph\u1EA9m ph\u1EE5
    \u0111\u1ED9c h\u1EA1i th\xF4ng qua qu\xE1 tr\xECnh \u0103n m\xF2n c\xF3 ki\u1EC3m
    so\xE1t. Trong c\xE1c s\u1EF1 c\u1ED1 r\xF2 r\u1EC9, c\xE1c nh\xE0 nghi\xEAn
    c\u1EE9u \u0111\xE3 quan s\xE1t th\u1EA5y t\xE1c d\u1EE5ng g\xE2y ch\u1EBFt ng\u01B0\u1EDDi
    c\u1EE7a ch\xFAng \u0111\u1ED1i v\u1EDBi c\xE1c sinh v\u1EADt th\xF9 \u0111\u1ECBch.
    C\xF4ng ngh\u1EC7 n\xE0y nhanh ch\xF3ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\xE1i s\u1EED d\u1EE5ng,
    l\xE0m d\u1EA5y l\xEAn nh\u1EEFng c\xE2u h\u1ECFi dai d\u1EB3ng v\u1EC1 \u0111\u1EA1o
    \u0111\u1EE9c trong chi\u1EBFn tranh h\xF3a h\u1ECDc."
